@{
    ViewBag.Title = "Cookie Policy";
}

<div class="legal-page">

    <div class="legal-header">
        <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: @DateTime.Now.ToString("d MMMM yyyy")</p>
    </div>

    <section>
        <h2>What cookies we use</h2>
        <p>
            Umbilo Rentals uses only one cookie: a session cookie set automatically
            by the website's technology (ASP.NET) to keep you logged in as you move
            between pages. Without it, the site would not remember who you are
            while you browse.
        </p>
        <p>
            This cookie is <strong>strictly necessary</strong> — the site cannot
            function without it, and it does not track you across other websites.
            It is deleted when you close your browser or log out.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>What we don't use</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>No advertising or marketing cookies.</li>
            <li>No third-party analytics or tracking scripts (such as Google Analytics or Facebook Pixel).</li>
            <li>No cross-site tracking of any kind.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
            Because the only cookie in use is strictly necessary for the site to
            function, we don't show a cookie consent banner — under most privacy
            frameworks (including guidance consistent with POPIA), consent isn't
            required for cookies that are essential to the service you've asked for.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Fonts and static assets</h2>
        <p>
            All fonts and icons used on this site are hosted directly on our own
            server, not loaded from a third-party CDN. This means visiting this
            site does not send your browser information to Google Fonts or similar
            third-party services.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Questions</h2>
        <p>
            If anything here changes (for example, if analytics are added in the
            future), this page will be updated and, if legally required, a consent
            banner will be added. Questions can be sent to
            <a href="mailto:info@umbilorentals.co.za">info@umbilorentals.co.za</a>.
        </p>
    </section>

</div>
